/P 263 0 R
/E (Research administration is inclusive of all types of sponsored programing. Research is any systematic investigation designed to develop or contribute to generalizable knowledge. It involves disciplined inquiry to find answers, solve problems, or create new understandings. This can include programmatic or community projects that support the local region, state, country, or the world.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
