<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 282 0 R
/E (Southern Utah University is leading the Southwest Utah Perkins Consortium. Perkins funding bridges hands-on technical instruction with high-wage, in-demand regional careers. By delivering targeted capital equipment, software, and instructional support across sectors like Construction, Health Sciences, Computer Science, and Emerging AI Technologies, the initiative ensures secondary and post-secondary students gain practical, industry-standard skill sets. This most recent award introduces data-driven budget reallocations based on recent Comprehensive Local Needs Assessment \(CLNA\) reviews, alongside an integrated fiscal management model at SUU designed to streamline compliance, subaward execution, and multi-agency collaboration across member counties.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
