789 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 285 0 R
/E (The AI4RA project continues to make massive strides in setting a standard for AI adoption in Research Administration across the nation. 2025-2026 focused on executing AI module implementation at SUU and broad dissemination. During this past year, AI4RA personnel offered 18 presentations at regional and national conferences and through open online webinars.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
790 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 285 0 R
/E (As an exciting development, the SPARC office has also expanded its innovative Research Analytics Team to include 5 student RATs. Under the direction of the new Director of Research Analytics, RAT interns develop, test, and maintain real-world, human-governed AI tools designed to streamline administrative workflows and expand institutional research capacity. Operating under a semester-long development cycle, each intern takes full ownership of a specific product and work as student problem-solvers. Interns collaborate in team problem-solving sessions, and receive direct technical mentorship to prepare for entry into the workforce.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
